  "description": "The Caferacer Lady Uno is a beautiful, classic “mixte” bike with a sensible price. Built around a classic lightweight welded Cromoly steel frame that is manufactured using traditional welding methods. It has all the features you need to ride with speed and comfort every day. Equipped with a comfy Creme saddle and gummy grips. A Chrome plated front rack is perfect for carrying luggage. The bike is full of great parts to ensure smooth and efficient functioning. And it looks unlike anything else on the market. A retro style Creme crank with forged alloy chainring. Stylish stainless steel fenders and a custom Creme high polished headset. The 3-speed Shimano Nexus internal gear hub integrated with a coaster brake is clean and service-free. Finished in a luxourious gloss paint in Rose Clay, Olive Green and Onyx.",
